  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNOCHA - Core Funding and Nigerian Humanitarian Fund Contribution</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FCDO provides core funding to OCHA Nigeria, primarily to:
Maintain humanitarian coordination capacity in Abuja, Maiduguri, Yola and Damaturu
Support inter-sector coordination, needs assessments, analysis, and emergency response mechanisms
Enable OCHA to run and strengthen the Nigeria Humanitarian Fund (NHF) 
FCDO also directly funds the NHF</narrative>
  </description>
